Description: A modern R client for the 'Airtable' REST API. Provides low-level
    wrappers for all API endpoints, high-level functions for reading, writing,
    upserting, and syncing records, and a DBI-compliant interface for
    RStudio/Positron connection pane integration.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/noamross/airtable2, https://noamross.github.io/airtable2/
